### 3. Additional context:
Selection criteria applied: RCTs comparing nutrition support vs control in hospitalized adults at nutritional risk. 
Excluded non-standard nutrition support, non-RCTs, reviews, editorials, and studies not involving hospitalized patients.
Conservative approach used - when in doubt, studies were included for further review.

Key exclusion reasons:
- Non-randomized designs (studies 16, 19, 32, 58, 81, 88, 89, 91, 92)
- Reviews/editorials/methodological papers (studies 21, 26, 29, 38, 50, 51, 87, 96, 97)
- Non-hospitalized populations (studies 2, 8, 12, 95)
- Wrong topic (study 14 - diabetes prevention)
- Unclear randomization (studies 20, 37)

