Overview of threats to the validity of evidence and how to minimise them", "abstract": "Using the best quality of 
clinical research evidence is essential for choosing the right treatment for patients. How to identify the best research
evidence is, however, difficult. In this narrative review we summarise these threats and describe how to minimise them. 
